{
  "_comment": [
    "Per-case metadata for the 29 clinical MGH evaluation cases of the AAPM CT-MAR",
    "Grand Challenge 2024. Read via mar_common.aapm_cases.load_eval_cases() by the",
    "two submission scripts (DuDoNet/eval/predscoring.py and",
    "Pconv_mar/evaluation/predscoring.py); override the path with --cases_meta.",
    "",
    "fov_mm   reconstruction FOV diameter of that scan. Unlike the simulated",
    "         training set (head 220.16 mm / body 400 mm) each clinical case has",
    "         its own FOV, so the reconstruction geometry is rebuilt per distinct",
    "         value.",
    "metal_hu constant HU value painted back into the segmented metal after",
    "         reconstruction; neither network predicts inside the metal. These are",
    "         the values the challenge asks for (highest non-metal value near the",
    "         metal + 250 HU margin + 1), listed per case in",
    "         example-main/AAPM_datachallenge/scoring_metric.md. The +1 matters:",
    "         the scorer counts voxels strictly ABOVE the threshold as metal, so a",
    "         value equal to the threshold scores zero metal integrity.",
    "norm     which head/body entry of configs/head_body_valid_stats.json",
    "         normalizes this case's projections. PConv-MAR only; DuDoNet takes no",
    "         projection normalization."
  ],
